      <text id="160:9" name="Not better network-wise — all three use the Rogers network. Rogers adds 5G+ priority, Canada–US plans and bigger perks; Fido and Chatr cost less." x="0" y="666" width="764" height="52" />
      <text id="160:10" name="What about phone financing?" x="0" y="738" width="764" height="33" />
      <text id="160:11" name="You can bring your own phone or finance one over 24 months. Financing lowers the upfront cost but ties you to the plan — ask us to compare the total cost." x="0" y="791" width="764" height="52" />
    </frame>
